# Local working notes — kept on disk, never published.
# Agent handoff docs, review rounds, and internal specs: they carry real session
# titles, local paths and a list of what is deliberately not covered yet, none of
# which belongs in a public repo.
HANDOFF.md
REVIEW-NOTES.md
SECURITY-FIXES.md
SKILLS-PLUGINS-SPEC.md
# Maintainer/agent review checklist (security invariants, coverage gaps). Local only.
CLAUDE.md
Claude.md

# Author's own tooling, not part of the app.
scripts/make-icon.mjs

# The shots harness (src/__shots.*, vite.shots.config.ts) is now tracked: it is
# what `npm run test:visual` renders, so it has to be in the repo. It is excluded
# from the app build by vite.shots.config.ts being a separate config, and from
# the packaged asar by electron-builder's files list.

# Fresh renders and diffs from `npm run test:visual`. Only the baseline is kept.
tests/visual/current/
tests/visual/diff/

# AI coding-assistant working directories. Ignored here rather than only in
# .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and never published — without this a
# contributor using one of these tools commits their local session state.
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*

# generated by scripts/preview-lifecycle/run.mjs
scripts/preview-lifecycle/preview.cjs
scripts/preview-lifecycle/package.json
